  "body": "Combining generous proportions, quality finishes, and outstanding versatility, this impressive Legal Home & Income residence offers an exceptional lifestyle opportunity in the heart of sought-after Millwater. Positioned on an approximately 660sqm section with a substantial floor area of approximately 341sqm (including deck), the home has been thoughtfully designed to accommodate large families, multi-generational living, or buyers looking to secure an additional rental income without compromising on comfort. For added confidence, the property also includes a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee.\r\n\r\nDesigned across two well-planned levels, the property offers a total of 6 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms and triple garage, comprising a spacious 4-bedroom main residence alongside a fully self-contained 2-bedroom legal minor dwelling.\r\n\r\nMAIN DWELLING: 4 Bed, 2.5 Bath and Double Garage\r\n\r\nDesigned to bring family and friends together, the ground floor is centred around a beautifully appointed open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area that enjoys an abundance of natural light. The well-appointed kitchen combines contemporary style with everyday functionality, featuring quality appliances, a spacious island bench, generous storage, and a well-equipped walk-in pantry that provides additional preparation and storage space. Large sliding doors create effortless indoor-outdoor flow to the sunny kwila deck, offering the perfect setting for alfresco dining, weekend BBQs, or simply relaxing in the sunshine.\r\n\r\nA conveniently located guest toilet on the ground floor adds extra practicality for everyday living and visiting guests.\r\n\r\nThe upper level has been thoughtfully designed to provide both privacy and flexibility for the whole family. A welcoming sitting area creates an additional living space, complete with a stylish bar area, making it the perfect spot to unwind, entertain guests, or enjoy a quiet evening. Sliding doors open directly to an elevated outdoor garden, offering a peaceful retreat and a seamless connection to outdoor living.\r\n\r\nThe spacious master suite serves as a private sanctuary, featuring a generous walk-in wardrobe and a beautifully appointed ensuite. Three additional well-proportioned bedrooms are thoughtfully positioned nearby and are serviced by a contemporary family bathroom with a bathtub, providing comfortable accommodation for growing families.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include:\r\n-Intercom system\r\n-Central air-conditioning\r\n-Double internal-access garage with laundry nook\r\n-Pre-wired EV charger\r\n\r\n\r\nLEGAL MINOR DWELLING: 2 Bed, 1 Bath and Single Garage\r\n\r\nCompletely self-contained with its own private entrance, the legal minor dwelling offers an outstanding opportunity for rental income or independent accommodation. The well-designed layout includes two generous bedrooms, a modern bathroom, a fully equipped kitchen, and an open-plan living and dining area complemented by its own heat pump for year-round comfort. A well-designed single garage adds everyday convenience, providing secure vehicle accommodation and extra room for storage.\r\n\r\nWhether accommodating tenants, extended family members, or long-term guests, this legal dwelling provides complete privacy while adding significant long-term value and flexibility.\r\n\r\nIdeally located near KingsWay School, Silverdale Mall, Northern Arena, and Orewa Beach, this home offers the perfect blend of elegance, flexibility, and convenience-an exceptional opportunity in the heart of Millwater.\r\n\r\nOffering exceptional space, flexibility, and investment appeal, this outstanding Legal Home & Income presents a rare opportunity to secure a premium property in one of Millwater's most desirable neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing.",
